# Semantic-index exclusions (#76), layered on SocratiCode's built-in defaults and
# .gitignore. Pinned by tests/ci/test_socraticode_config.py. Governs the code index and
# graph only, never the context artifacts (docs/SOCRATICODE.md).

# Vendored gregoryfoster/skills and obra/superpowers. skills/ and .claude/skills/ are
# symlinks into skills-vendor/ (no overrides), and .skills/ holds the installed
# doctor.sh. Left in, they outnumber co-status's own files, and notifier's
# includeLinked search would serve them as status.
skills-vendor/
skills/
.claude/skills/
.skills/

# The hooks that are symlinks into skills-vendor/, by name: an indexer that follows
# symlinks would reach the vendored tree through them. gh-env.sh is co-status's own
# (#92) and stays in.
.claude/hooks/skills-submodule-update.sh
.claude/hooks/socraticode-health.sh
.claude/hooks/socraticode-reminder.sh

# Worktrees: using-git-worktrees' root and the harness's, both inside this tree.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/

# Dated prose. Searchable as the implementation-plans context artifact; out of the
# code index so a superseded plan cannot outrank the source it describes.
docs/plans/
